<title>USA: Jamaica buys 2,700 tonnes PL-480 rice - agent.</title>
<headline>Jamaica buys 2,700 tonnes PL-480 rice - agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jamaica bought 2,700 tonnes of U.S. rice in bulk on Friday under the PL-480 donation program, its export agent said.</p>
<p>The rice was U.S. no. 5 or better long grain brown rice.</p>
<p>Delivery was set for May 20-June 5, the agent said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
